# The title theme, sixty seconds — the window the console's hosted bench ran.
#
# 3601 ticks is what `zig build hostedbench` sends for EXCERPT $3C: the SNES
# counts its own frames at 60.0988 Hz, so this is the console's window and not
# a round number of Game Boy seconds. It exists to answer one question the
# console raised: the title theme appeared to stop before the excerpt ended,
# and this is where the Game Boy is asked whether it does the same.
